.TH ngx-disable 1  "ngx-disable " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-disable \- Disable a site without deleting it (`ngx enable` brings it back with the same ID)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-disable\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISITE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Disable a site without deleting it (`ngx enable` brings it back with the same ID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would change without touching anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISITE\fR>
Site ID (from `ngx ls`) or any of its domain names
